{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-0r.ancient": "一位法师。塔已经很久没有见过真正的魔法了。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-1r.char": "这座塔……像是被某种意志从噩梦中浇筑出来的。你也是它的囚徒吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-2r.ancient": "囚徒？不，我是它的建筑师。而你，是我尚未完工的作品。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-0r.ancient": "你的霜寒渗进了塔的基石。有趣，很少有东西能让这座塔颤抖。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-1r.char": "颤抖的从来不是塔，而是塔里那些不肯安息的灵魂。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-2r.ancient": "灵魂只是建材。就像你的寒冰，也只是我的蓝图里一道笔触。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.2-0r.ancient": "法师，你已走到最后一道门。回答我——你建造了什么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.2-0r.next": "回答",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.2-1r.char": "我建造的是守护。库尔提拉斯的海风，塞拉摩的灯火，还有……我亲手写下的每一道咒语。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.JAINA_CHARACTER_JAINA.2-2r.ancient": "那就用你的守护来证明吧。这座塔，会记住你的名字。"
}
